BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Coyote vs Acme (2026)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260927T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260927T210000
UID:bat-202609271900-coyote-vs-acme-2026-@bloomingtonarts.today
DESCRIPTION:$. After Acme products fail him one too many times in his dogg
 ed pursuit of the Roadrunner\, Wile E. Coyote decides to hire a billboard 
 lawyer (Will Forte) to sue the Acme Corporation.\n\nStarring: Will Forte\,
  Lana Condor\, Tone Bell\, John Cena\nRated: PG\nLength: 1hr 50mins
LOCATION:Buskirk-Chumley Theater
URL:https://buskirkchumley.org/events/coyote-vs-acme-2026-september-26-202
 6/
X-SOURCE:BloomingtonArts.Today
END:VEVENT
