DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261002T210000
UID:bat-202610021900-an-evening-with-cliff-cash@bloomingtonarts.today
DESCRIPTION:$. Cliff Cash is a nationally touring stand-up comedian known 
 for thoughtful\, road-tested comedy and a nomadic lifestyle spent performi
 ng across the U.S. His special The Long Road became a breakout hit in 2025
 \, topping the iTunes comedy chart and earning millions of views online.
LOCATION:The Comedy Attic
URL:https://www.comedyattic.com/events/133267
X-SOURCE:BloomingtonArts.Today
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tomorrow's Sentry
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261002T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261002T210000
UID:bat-202610021900-tomorrow-s-sentry@bloomingtonarts.today
DESCRIPTION:$. When 102-year-old Bloomington resident Dot Weaver dies\, sh
 e left behind fragments of a hidden history waiting to be discovered. Audi
 ences are taken on an unforgettable journey though Monroe County’s contr
 oversial history — from the post Civil War era to today.
LOCATION:Waldron Auditorium @ Waldron Arts Center
URL:https://resilienceproductions.org/upcoming-productions
X-SOURCE:BloomingtonArts.Today
END:VEVENT
