BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Kyle Kinane's Triumphant Return to Bloomington!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261008T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261008T220000
UID:bat-202610082000-kyle-kinane-s-triumphant-return-to-bloom@bloomingtona
 rts.today
DESCRIPTION:$. Kyle Kinane is a stand-up comedian from Addison\, Illinois 
 known for his gruff storytelling style and multiple acclaimed comedy speci
 als\, including 2024’s Dirt Nap. He’s appeared on The Tonight Show\, N
 etflix’s The Standups\, Love\, and Drunk History\, and co-hosts the podc
 ast No Accounting for Taste.
LOCATION:The Comedy Attic
URL:https://www.comedyattic.com/events/132563
X-SOURCE:BloomingtonArts.Today
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Paula Poundstone
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261009T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261009T210000
UID:bat-202610091900-paula-poundstone@bloomingtonarts.today
DESCRIPTION:$. Iconic comedian Paula Poundstone is known for her smart\, o
 bservational humor and a spontaneous wit that has become the stuff of lege
 nd. She regularly plays theaters across the country\, hosts a weekly comed
 y podcast\, Nobody Listens to Paula Poundstone\, and is a regular panelist
  on NPR’s Wait\, Wait… Don’t Tell Me. She also voiced the character 
 ‘Forgetter Paula’ in the feature films Inside Out and Inside Out 2.
LOCATION:Buskirk-Chumley Theater
URL:https://buskirkchumley.org/events/paula-poundstone-october-9-2026
X-SOURCE:BloomingtonArts.Today
END:VEVENT
