DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261016T210000
UID:bat-202610161900-partita-an-evening-with-barbara-kingsolv@bloomingtona
 rts.today
DESCRIPTION:$. Join Pulitzer Prize-winning author Barbara Kingsolver for a
 n evening of readings\, questions\, and musical performances by Jacobs Sch
 ool of Music pianist Susan Tsai to celebrate the release of her brand-new 
 novel Partita.
